            "basis_claimed": "the ACCEPT already isolated H-4, so skipping the adjacent hotwells is the cheapest survey",
        },
        "safety_decision": {
            "decision": "REJECT",
            "rationale": "Skip-isolate of H-1..H-3 is refused. The 12 min survey floor is complete and the isolate tripwire (kappa >= 20.00) is still armed on the plant cation-conductivity head. REJECT the skip. Do not trip the dump. H-4 hold stands. 20.00 uS/cm post-accept is still at the 20.00 isolate floor, so H-4 stays held; H-1..H-3 remain unmeasured and in scope.",
            "threshold": "surv_floor_complete AND skip_not_taken AND dump_not_tripped AND h4_held AND h13_in_scope",
        },
        "executed_action": {
